\end{split}
\end{equation}
Expanding the derivative and using cohomology invariance of $S$ and Cor.~\ref{cor:SzeroCoboundaries} shows that this expression evaluates to 0, as the latter two arguments are fixed to coboundaries.
\end{proof}

